md='''# VNM S3 competitive position — CLOSED

S3 research gap is **CLOSED** at the retained30October2026 cutoff under existing IC-POS/M3 contracts. Evidence supports an **established competitive franchise with meaningful brand/distribution capabilities and demonstrated operating scale**. It does not establish lowest-cost status, an exact peer rank, share gain or sustainable clear leadership. No formal points or scoring band are assigned.

## Policy and mandatory topics

METRIC_DEFINITIONS §7.2 and SCORING_MODEL §8.2 evaluate share, relative cost, distribution, quality, efficiency, scale and strategic position; executable methodology.ts requires share/cost_position/distribution. §13.3 expressly permits own-history/absolute economics when peer context is unavailable; SECTOR_NORMALIZATION §§2.3,3.2,8,18 supports this approach. Those rules allow a conservative capability assessment; they do not allow translating unlike measures into invented market share or a cost league table.

| Topic | Supported assessment | Counterevidence / limit |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Share / market position | Domestic accounting scale, issuer-attributed household purchase reach and category positioning support established presence. | Exact share and peer rank N/R. FY2025 domestic growth onlyabout0.3%; compare neither group growth nor domestic accounting growth with issuer-cited retail-industry−2.4% to infer gain. |
| Cost position | Four annual observations, supply-chain/input capabilities and current interim margins support operating capability. | No rival unit-cost data, constant-mix price-volume attribution or cheapest-cost claim. Input inflation and limited pass-through explicitly retained. |
| Distribution | Issuer describes multi-channel activity, stores/e-commerce development, product renewal and servicing infrastructure. | Traditional-channel restructuring caused disruption; autonomous-sales transition and competitive investment remain execution risks. No outlet-density rank or exclusivity inferred. |

## Definition firewall and evidence strength

S3_EVIDENCE_MATRIX.json labels every evidence row FACT, ESTIMATE, ASSUMPTION or ANALYST_JUDGMENT. An attributed award/ranking is a fact of issuer reporting, not independently verified panel truth. Physical pages26/27 of the annual report carry market/threat narratives; page60 carries the near9/10-households,14purchases/year and13th-year brand statement. These are reach/frequency/attributed ranking, **not90% sales share**. Page46's condensed-milk/probiotic leadership descriptions remain issuer/category-specific; no whole-market leader certification.

Annual report pages28/39/41 describe sourcing, cold-chain and operational organization; these are capabilities, not peer cost proof. Pages42/43 support product renewal/quality activities without proving defect-free outcomes or medical efficacy. Pages5/35/46 show channel restructuring alongside channel development; page27 describes limited pass-through, selective demand and rivalry. Page98 identifies technology-adaptation risks. Marketing awards alone cannot establish unlimited pricing power or immutable moat.

Annual financial inputsFY2022–2025 are reused unchanged from the S1 source selections, without requalifying S1. Reported gross margin spansabout39.86–41.42%; selling intensity/core operating margins remain visible so a high gross margin is not mistaken for low servicing cost. Paired9M2026/2025 inputs retain the reclassified prior basis. The latest interim evidence updates operating context; it does not prove channel reach unchanged or provide a new share survey.

## Research judgment, confidence and invalidation

IC-POS conclusion is descriptive and conservative: competitive position is supported, with meaningful brand/distribution strengths. Confidence is MEDIUM for this bounded conclusion and limited for comparative share/unit cost, exact pricing power and permanent leadership. Market share percentages, external percentiles, exact rival outlet counts and measured price elasticity stay N/R. No numeric0–4 award, maximum-band adoption, source promotion or HUMAN-analyst provenance is manufactured.

Reassess on public comparable evidence of persistent reach/share loss, failed channel restructuring, material quality/service breakdown, sustained margin deterioration after mix/input effects, or competing specialist propositions eroding demand. These are thesis invalidation conditions, not invented observations or arbitrary thresholds. Brand evidence is contextual here; this package awards no BQ-MOAT points, industry/growth/capital-allocation points or duplicated economics credit.

## Closure and preservation

All mandatory IC-POS topics have positive evidence, counterevidence, definitions, confidence and invalidation conditions in S3_IC_POS_ASSESSMENT.json. The older blanket peer-table requirement is superseded only for S3 research by the permitted absolute/own-history assessment. Missing exact parameters constrain interpretation rather than block this bounded conclusion. No indispensable S3 evidence remains missing and no new industry research/PDF/competitor dataset is requested.

S3_ACCEPTANCE.json records closure; VALIDATION.json must pass source/native checks, topic/definition/authority regressions and deterministic replay. CURRENT_BLOCKER_REGISTER.md carries forward unrelated gates without investigating them. Original sources, old pending assessments and S1/S2/S4 acceptance remain unchanged. F1/F2 approvals, VNM17 pending, M3/M4 rules, portfolio/transactions/NAV and production permissions remain unchanged. **STOP after S3; no S5 work.**
'''
(O/'S3_COMPETITIVE_POSITION_RESOLUTION.md').write_text(md)
